{"type":"message","id":"1820085b","parentId":"41c69b75","timestamp":"2026-06-23T08:57:30.861Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is talking about their account balance or some numbers. Let me parse this: \"到5080现在掉回5000\" - this seems to be about USDT balance. The health check earlier showed 4944.57 USDT available. Let me check the current balance and positions to see what's changed.\n\nActually, the earlier query showed:\n- 4 positions with floating PnL: +3.62 USDT\n- Daily realized: +12.93 USDT\n- Net: +16.55 USDT\n\nBut the balance was 4944.57 USDT. Let me re-check the current state to see what \"5080\" and \"5000\" refer to. Maybe they're referring to the Binance account balance (total wallet balance).\n\nLet me check the current positions and balance.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_l5nHhpiGEXpkbSeBQZwo9629","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 -c \"\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0,'.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\n# 查账户余额\naccount = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v2/balance')\nif isinstance(account, list):\n    usdt = next((a for a in account if a.get('asset') == 'USDT'), {})\n    print(f\\\"钱包余额: {float(usdt.get('balance',0)):.2f} USDT\\\")\n    print(f\\\"可用余额: {float(usdt.get('availableBalance',0)):.2f} USDT\\\")\n    print(f\\\"未实现盈亏: {float(usdt.get('crossUnPnl',0)):.2f} USDT\\\")\n\n# 查持仓\npositions = bat.get_all_positions() or []\nfor p in positions:\n    print(f\\\"{p.get('symbol')} {p.get('type')} 入{p.get('entry_price',0):.4g} 现{p.get('current_price',0):.4g} 浮动{p.get('unrealized_pnl',0):+.4f}\\\")\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":3581,"output":656,"cacheRead":41856,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46093,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1782205041376}}
