{"type":"message","id":"52805439","parentId":"69182dfa","timestamp":"2026-06-23T08:58:42.616Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is worried about the 36.1% win rate being too low for live trading. This is a valid concern. Let me provide some perspective:\n\n1. Win rate alone isn't the full picture - the P&L ratio (2.14:1) means the strategy is profitable despite low win rate\n2. This is a trend-following strategy, which typically has lower win rates but higher reward-to-risk ratios\n3. 36% win rate with 2.14:1 P&L is mathematically positive expectancy\n\nBut I should be honest and not push them into live trading. I should explain the math and let them decide.\n\nHowever, this is a group chat. I should keep it brief and not give financial advice. Let me respond naturally.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"胜率低不一定差，你这个策略 36% 胜率 + 2.14:1 盈亏比，期望值算一下：\n\n**每 100 笔**：赢 36 笔 × $3.34 = +$120.24，亏 64 笔 × $1.56 = -$99.84，净 +$20.40\n\n正期望的。趋势跟随策略天生就是低胜率高盈亏比，赚大亏小。\n\n但话说回来，Testnet 和实战确实不一样——滑点、情绪、手续费都会更狠。不急，等你自己觉得有信心了再说。Testnet 继续跑着积累数据，胜率能稳在 35% 以上、盈亏比不掉下 1.8，就有底气了 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1180,"output":481,"cacheRead":45952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47613,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1782205112641}}
